SET ECHO OFF
STOP_ON_ERROR OFF
ECHO === OI-031: NULLASSERT through the BRACKETED regression path ===
ECHO
ECHO Not DOTSCRIPT. REGRESSION RUN takes the L3 catalog-isolation arm before and
ECHO after, the CatalogBracket, the marker-count grader and the rollup -- the
ECHO machinery REGRESSION ALL actually runs through, and the machinery that has
ECHO only ever seen this spec green.
ECHO
ECHO READ THE COUNT FIRST AND THE VERDICTS SECOND. An errored marker PRINTS
ECHO NOTHING rather than going red, so a transcript with 20 is a spec that lost
ECHO a claim, not a spec that passed. 21 graded: 5 NL_G* guards, 16 NL_T* arms.
ECHO The 3 NL_P* probes are UNGRADED and are not part of the 21.
ECHO
ECHO If any NL_G* reds, every NL_T* is UNPROVEN -- the arms read fields of rows
ECHO the guards establish.
REGRESSION RUN NULLASSERT
ECHO === run done ===
